   "title": "APPROVE HERE = ANIMATION FIRES",
   "text": "This board is the animation gate. Approve the frames (or mark swaps: every scene has 2 rejected variants on disk next to the picks) and animation starts: Seedance 2.5 native audio for hook, problem and CTA beats; stills with Ken Burns for packing, interior and bin; Omni or push-in for the walking beat. Nothing animates before this approval.",
