   "text": "66 variants + 3 repair edits rolled, every frame audited by a fresh-context auditor against the real product photos. 22 picks passed. Recurring rejects: invented rivets, key bell on a long lanyard, suede texture drift, denim organizer inserts (repaired on v1, clean picks elsewhere). No shoulder straps, zippers, silver hardware or wrong-scale bags in any pick.",
